<div class="jp-CodeMirrorEditor jp-Editor jp-InputArea-editor" data-type="inline">
<div class="cm-editor cm-s-jupyter">
<div class="highlight hl-ipython3"><pre><span></span><span class="c1"># </span>
</pre></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="jp-Cell jp-MarkdownCell jp-Notebook-cell" id="cell-id=7e22d8fc-ddd2-46b6-b497-9966d5492d2f">
<div class="jp-Cell-inputWrapper" tabindex="0">
<div class="jp-Collapser jp-InputCollapser jp-Cell-inputCollapser">
</div>
<div class="jp-InputArea jp-Cell-inputArea"><div class="jp-InputPrompt jp-InputArea-prompt">
</div><div class="jp-RenderedHTMLCommon jp-RenderedMarkdown jp-MarkdownOutput" data-mime-type="text/markdown">
<h1 id="I-started-this-project-to-understand-how-an-e-commerce-business-works-by-looking-at-its-sales-data.-My-goal-was-to-move-from-simple-data-cleaning-to-using-advanced-AIML-techniques-to-find-useful-secrets-in-the-numbers.-The-project-followed-four-main-steps:-cleaning,-analyzing-single-variables,-looking-at-relationships,-and-finally,-calculating-probabilities.">I started this project to understand how an e-commerce business works by looking at its sales data. My goal was to move from simple data cleaning to using advanced AIML techniques to find useful secrets in the numbers. The project followed four main steps: cleaning, analyzing single variables, looking at relationships, and finally, calculating probabilities.<a class="anchor-link" href="#I-started-this-project-to-understand-how-an-e-commerce-business-works-by-looking-at-its-sales-data.-My-goal-was-to-move-from-simple-data-cleaning-to-using-advanced-AIML-techniques-to-find-useful-secrets-in-the-numbers.-The-project-followed-four-main-steps:-cleaning,-analyzing-single-variables,-looking-at-relationships,-and-finally,-calculating-probabilities.">¶</a></h1><h1 id="In-the-beginning,-I-noticed-that-the-Price-data-was-very-%22skewed.%22-This-means-most-products-were-cheap,-but-a-few-expensive-ones-made-the-average-look-wrong.-To-fix-this,-I-used-a-technique-called-the-Box-Cox-transformation.-This-balanced-the-data-and-turned-it-into-a-%22Normal-Distribution,%22-which-looks-like-a-perfect-bell-curve.-This-was-a-very-important-step-because-it-made-all-my-later-math-much-more-accurate.">In the beginning, I noticed that the Price data was very "skewed." This means most products were cheap, but a few expensive ones made the average look wrong. To fix this, I used a technique called the Box-Cox transformation. This balanced the data and turned it into a "Normal Distribution," which looks like a perfect bell curve. This was a very important step because it made all my later math much more accurate.<a class="anchor-link" href="#In-the-beginning,-I-noticed-that-the-Price-data-was-very-%22skewed.%22-This-means-most-products-were-cheap,-but-a-few-expensive-ones-made-the-average-look-wrong.-To-fix-this,-I-used-a-technique-called-the-Box-Cox-transformation.-This-balanced-the-data-and-turned-it-into-a-%22Normal-Distribution,%22-which-looks-like-a-perfect-bell-curve.-This-was-a-very-important-step-because-it-made-all-my-later-math-much-more-accurate.">¶</a></h1><h1 id="Next,-I-used-KDE-to-look-at-the-probability-of-prices.-By-using-the-integrate_box_1d-function,-I-found-that-there-is-a-99.79%25-probability-that-our-products-fall-within-a-specific-price-range-(between-3-and-7-in-our-transformed-units).-This-gives-the-company-a-%22safe-zone%22-to-understand-where-most-of-their-pricing-happens.">Next, I used KDE to look at the probability of prices. By using the integrate_box_1d function, I found that there is a 99.79% probability that our products fall within a specific price range (between 3 and 7 in our transformed units). This gives the company a "safe zone" to understand where most of their pricing happens.<a class="anchor-link" href="#Next,-I-used-KDE-to-look-at-the-probability-of-prices.-By-using-the-integrate_box_1d-function,-I-found-that-there-is-a-99.79%25-probability-that-our-products-fall-within-a-specific-price-range-(between-3-and-7-in-our-transformed-units).-This-gives-the-company-a-%22safe-zone%22-to-understand-where-most-of-their-pricing-happens.">¶</a></h1><h1 id="The-main-thing-is--when-I-checked-Conditional-Probability.-I-wanted-to-know:-if-a-product-is-high-priced,-what-is-the-chance-it-is-an-electronic-item-or-any-other-item-?-The-answer-was-70.96%25.-This-taught-me-that-Electronics-are-the-real-money-makers-for-the-business.-They-don't-need-huge-discounts-to-sell-because-people-are-already-willing-to-pay-a-premium-price-for-them.">The main thing is  when I checked Conditional Probability. I wanted to know: if a product is high-priced, what is the chance it is an electronic item or any other item ? The answer was 70.96%. This taught me that Electronics are the real money-makers for the business. They don't need huge discounts to sell because people are already willing to pay a premium price for them.<a class="anchor-link" href="#The-main-thing-is--when-I-checked-Conditional-Probability.-I-wanted-to-know:-if-a-product-is-high-priced,-what-is-the-chance-it-is-an-electronic-item-or-any-other-item-?-The-answer-was-70.96%25.-This-taught-me-that-Electronics-are-the-real-money-makers-for-the-business.-They-don't-need-huge-discounts-to-sell-because-people-are-already-willing-to-pay-a-premium-price-for-them.">¶</a></h1><h1 id="My-Recommendation-is">My Recommendation is<a class="anchor-link" href="#My-Recommendation-is">¶</a></h1><h1 id="As-a-result-of-this-analysis,-I-suggest-the-company-should-stop-giving-general-discounts-to-everything.-Instead,-they-should-keep-the-prices-of-Electronics-high-and-only-use-discounts-for-categories-like-Clothing-or-Beauty-to-move-stock-faster.-This-data-story-shows-that-a-%22category-specific%22-strategy-is-much-smarter-and-will-help-the-company-make-more-profit.---%3E">As a result of this analysis, I suggest the company should stop giving general discounts to everything. Instead, they should keep the prices of Electronics high and only use discounts for categories like Clothing or Beauty to move stock faster. This data story shows that a "category-specific" strategy is much smarter and will help the company make more profit. --&gt;<a class="anchor-link" href="#As-a-result-of-this-analysis,-I-suggest-the-company-should-stop-giving-general-discounts-to-everything.-Instead,-they-should-keep-the-prices-of-Electronics-high-and-only-use-discounts-for-categories-like-Clothing-or-Beauty-to-move-stock-faster.-This-data-story-shows-that-a-%22category-specific%22-strategy-is-much-smarter-and-will-help-the-company-make-more-profit.---%3E">¶</a></h1>
</div>
</div>
</div>
